Z||000011||Fierokid87||08-01-2001||02:22 AM||||Same difference Galen.  They both sound like sowing machines.  Why do you think Im going to a V-6.  Oh and input on Duel exaust for a 4 cyld.  Sounds pretty good.  More throatier.<P>Scott<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLOODY"> Fierokid's  Web site<BR>http://www.angelfire.com/sports/sfiero<P>AIM: Fierokid87<BR>ICQ: Fierokid</FONT><P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||10
